Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?tools(gguf):=20retag=20v3=20=E2=80=94=20verifie?=
 =?UTF-8?q?d=20type-id=20rewrite=2042->43?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Records type-field byte offsets in the lightweight parse; rewrites ONLY
span-verified 42->43 type fields with re-read-before-overwrite; byte-for-byte
tensor-table validation allowing only those substitutions; post-write span
re-verify with expected type 43. README corrected (marker is UINT8).

One necessary completion beyond Sol's literal diff: main() line reassigned to
'verification = _verify_q2_spans(source_layout)' to capture the source span
verification the diff threads into _retag_in_place/_retag_copy; without it the
diff references an undefined name. Flagged to HQ.

Origin: ArifiLabs lane-110
Measured-effect: build fix only
